3528 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\015\nLed a multidisciplinary team of 6 from concept to playable exhibit prototype in 13 weeks\054 managing external client and advisor relationships\054 rebuilding client trust\054 handling internal team conflicts\054 leading production planning\054 budgeting\054 procurement\054 and narrative development\056\nDelivered a minimum viable product with easy potential for expansion for the museum\220s 2027 exhibit on Western Pennsylvania\047s amusement park heritage\056\nLed playtest data collection with family groups and museum visitors\054 iterated in real\055time between sessions based on observed user behaviour\054 and improved the exhibit based on our data analysis\056\nAuthored client handoff documentation for fabrication\054 install\054 and maintenance\054 including tiered budgets \050\044766 feasible \057 \0441\054160 ideal\051 with sourced vendors\054 material recommendations for preventive care of high\055touch objects\054 public\055safety fixes\054 playtest\055backed design rationale to reproduce\054 maintain\054 expand exhibit\056)
     /K [ 21 ]
     /P 3529 0 R
     /Pg 3493 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

