3536 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\015\nDesigned a multi\055phase pre\055show experience for CMU School of Drama\220s Titanic the Musical\054 experienced by \1764\054000 guests across 9 sold\055out performances\056 \nDesigned user journeys and audience personas\056 Ensured space design met accessibility standards\056 Created multisensory interactions that were inclusive for the enjoyment of guests with disabilities\056\nResearched and designed emotional backstories for characters by curating props to be packed into their suitcases\054 writing personalized fictional accounts and audio\055narrative voiceover scripts\056\015\n3D printed and soldered old handset receivers housing speakers\054 and custom object mounts\056 These interactables ensured no room for error from unpredictable guest behavior\056 \nGraphic design for vintage props\056 Designed logo\054 poster\054 and branding guidelines for the team\056)
     /K [ 27 ]
     /P 3537 0 R
